/T (1. NABKISAN FINANCE LIMITED :   The main objective of the company is to provide credit for promotion, expansion and commercialization of enterprises in agriculture, allied and rural non-farm activities. NKFL is providing support for livelihood engaged / income generating activities by extending credit to Panchayat Level Federations, Trusts, Societies and Section 25 companies/ MFIs for on-lending to its member SHGs/ JLGs.    NABARD provides all types of support to NABKISAN viz., Refinance, Credit Guarantee support, grant support and guidance which enabled NABKISAN to emerge as a leader in FPO lending.  )
/E (1. NABKISAN FINANCE LIMITED :   The main objective of the company is to provide credit for promotion, expansion and commercialization of enterprises in agriculture, allied and rural non-farm activities. NKFL is providing support for livelihood engaged / income generating activities by extending credit to Panchayat Level Federations, Trusts, Societies and Section 25 companies/ MFIs for on-lending to its member SHGs/ JLGs.    NABARD provides all types of support to NABKISAN viz., Refinance, Credit Guarantee support, grant support and guidance which enabled NABKISAN to emerge as a leader in FPO lending.  )
